      "description": "<p>Yorgen Fenech cleared on both charges he faced over 2017 killing of journalist that prompted global outrage</p><p>One of Malta’s richest men has been found not guilty of involvement in the murder of the anti-corruption journalist Daphne Caruana Galizia.</p><p>The verdict, which is expected to be appealed against by the prosecution, came as a blow not only to the victim’s family, but to the politicians and campaigners who regard the case as a landmark action in the fight to protect press freedom in Europe.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/sep/02/maltese-tycoon-yorgen-fenech-daphne-caruana-galizia-killing-not-guilty\">Continue reading...</a>",
